  "registration": "The four-view board locks one Modern Concert Hall - Opposing Bronze Acoustic Curves with 88 m by 62 m, four public levels; two thick continuous bronze shell walls curve in opposite directions around one central auditorium and glazed foyer canyon, their crests descend toward opposite planted terraces, the entry is carved between them beneath a timber soffit, and all rear edges and roof seams close as one weather-tight building. The fixed landmark consumes that complete topology; LEGO fallback modules repeat only audited ordinary middle bays.",
